Maybe he gets a shower now.

77
00:19:37,663 --> 00:19:42,353
I just had a shower. I was on a frozen
lake, I fell in the water.

78
00:19:44,677 --> 00:19:46,957
That was a couple springs ago.

79
00:19:49,859 --> 00:19:54,139
Bury the dead soldiers according to
their religion. Talk to Papa.

80
00:19:54,307 --> 00:19:56,998
- Eyvallah my Bey.
- Let's help Osman Bey!

81
00:19:56,998 --> 00:19:58,668
Let's go!

82
00:20:26,011 --> 00:20:28,031
Retreat!

83
