We could defeat them.

87
00:21:15,583 --> 00:21:18,983
But Osman blew up the tunnels!

88
00:21:56,130 --> 00:21:58,560
Thank Allah.

89
00:22:03,542 --> 00:22:05,292
Thank Allah.

90
00:22:06,602 --> 00:22:08,392
Thank Allah.

91
00:22:18,466 --> 00:22:20,856
You saved my life Osman Bey.

92
00:22:26,327 --> 00:22:33,697
The alps of two tents have merged.
We showed who we are to infidels!

93
00:22:34,271 --> 00:22:36,521
May our partnerhip be forever!

94
00:22:37,021 --> 00:22:38,781
May it be!

95
00:22:43,524 --> 00:22:49,894
Game is over. Infidels drowned in
their blood.

96
00:22:51,281 --> 00:22:55,901
They came to destroy Sogut, but we
made Sogut their grave!

97
00:22:57,003 --> 00:23:03,083
We are keeping on, we yell victory to
break the enemy!

98
00:23:03,700 --> 00:23:07,180
From now on, our way is victory,
our name is "The victorious"...

99
00:23:07,715 --> 00:23:10,925
Until we make the religion Islam...

100
00:23:11,343 --> 00:23:15,113
and the state Turkish!

101
00:23:15,113 --> 00:23:33,223
Allah is the greatest!

102
00:23:44,724 --> 00:23:57,544
Take the ashes of our dead soldiers.

103
00:24:03,632 --> 00:24:09,202
Black Shaman Togay...

104
00:24:09,632 --> 00:24:19,962
presents you the brave soldiers' souls.

105
00:24:34,658 --> 00:24:37,158
Erlik Khan.

106
00:24:39,278 --> 00:24:40,718
Accept it.

107
00:25:20,251 --> 00:25:24,511
Nicola's soldiers were buried in
the tunnels.

108
00:25:25,088 --> 00:25:27,358
- How can it be?
- It's the flying barrel.

109
00:25:28,490 --> 00:25:32,492
I don't know how Osman found it.

110
