From Nicola's castle, of course.

111
00:25:35,733 --> 00:25:40,143
Osman took revenge for my soldiers.

112
00:25:40,820 --> 00:25:43,008
Nicola's soldiers are dead.

113
00:25:43,008 --> 00:25:48,788
After this lose,
he needs my soldiers more than ever,

114
00:25:49,932 --> 00:25:55,662
Just like how soil needs rain.

115
00:25:56,407 --> 00:26:01,104
Lord of Yarhisar has to keep paying taxes
to Seljuqs.

116
00:26:01,104 --> 00:26:06,164
He knows his taxes he pay to Seljuqs
go to Geyhatu.

117
00:26:06,353 --> 00:26:11,930
He trusts Nicola. He isn't strong enough
to disobey Khan of the Khans.

118
00:26:11,930 --> 00:26:14,210
What are we going to do Togay?

119
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:21,840
We'll check if Nicola learned his lesson
when I sent him Commanders' heads.

120
00:26:22,670 --> 00:26:30,050
If he didn't, we'll wake Nicola up
from his dreams.

121
00:26:43,951 --> 00:26:47,951
Osman Bey is coming!
Osman Bey is coming!

122
00:26:48,397 --> 00:26:52,347
Osman Bey is coming!
Osman Bey is coming!

123
00:26:52,347 --> 00:26:54,497
Long live Osman Bey.

124
00:26:59,253 --> 00:27:01,103
Thank you.

125
00:27:01,717 --> 00:27:03,647
Thank you.

126
00:27:04,018 --> 00:27:05,798
Thank you.

127
00:27:12,464 --> 00:27:15,467
Thank Allah, they returned with victory.

128
00:27:15,467 --> 00:27:18,667
Thank Allah, my Gonca.
They are back safe and sound.

129
00:27:26,037 --> 00:27:30,056
Hey Masha Allah, Hey
Masha Allah(praise be) sons!

130
00:27:30,056 --> 00:27:33,866
What a victory!
What a huge victory this is!

131
00:27:33,950 --> 00:27:37,599
You made the infidels regret it,
Osman Bey.!

132
00:27:37,599 --> 00:27:40,989
- You are the man, you are the best!
- Eyvallah (thank you).

133
00:27:40,989 --> 00:27:44,349
The righteous people always win,
Davut Bey.

134
00:27:44,704 --> 00:27:48,515
Even if all the enemy attacks, they
can't dfefeat the righteous people.

135
00:27:48,515 --> 00:27:52,935
You are right, Kumral Abdal, the only
thing enemy gets is defeat!

136
00:27:52,935 --> 00:27:56,410
You're in the tent from now on,
you'll see many victories inshallah.

137
00:27:56,410 --> 00:27:59,690
Thank you, thank you.

138
00:28:05,697 --> 00:28:08,277
May your victory be everlasting,
Osman Bey.

139
