148
00:28:54,547 --> 00:28:58,237
I don't know, I must be hungry
I tihnk.

149
00:28:59,232 --> 00:29:03,982
Excuse us. We shall go to our tent. We
will notify Umur Bey.

150
00:29:04,013 --> 00:29:10,823
May Allah bless you Malhun Hatun.
You helped us a lot.

151
00:29:11,770 --> 00:29:16,620
You paved the way for victory.

152
00:29:18,041 --> 00:29:20,791
War is our thing, Osman Bey.

153
00:29:21,293 --> 00:29:24,383
I owe you my life.

154
00:29:25,642 --> 00:29:28,062
Do not even mention it.

155
00:29:28,909 --> 00:29:32,539
You owe your life only to Allah.

156
00:29:39,566 --> 00:29:41,926
Tell Umur Bey that I invite you.

157
00:29:41,942 --> 00:29:43,910
I wait for him in my dinner.

158
00:29:43,910 --> 00:29:49,760
Of course, Osman Bey. Umur Bey will
be pleased.

159
00:29:51,653 --> 00:29:53,293
Eyvallah (thank you).

160
00:29:56,844 --> 00:30:01,184
- My Ahmet Alp.
- May your victory be everlasting, Osman Bey.

161
00:30:02,316 --> 00:30:05,666
Hey Mashallah(praise be), I'd die for you!

162
